        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.09000000000003,
          "end": 284.14,
          "en": "But here, I'll actually add a new method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.22,
          "end": 288.06,
          "en": "addItem could be a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.06,
          "end": 291.96,
          "en": "And this method doesn't return anything at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.96,
          "end": 294.06,
          "en": "therefore I'll add it like this.",
