        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 299.01,
          "end": 303.27,
          "en": "So, this _addItem function I just added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.27,
          "end": 307.44,
          "en": "And inside of addItem, I will now use the Navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.44,
          "end": 308.64,
          "en": "which is built into Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.64,
          "end": 311.13,
          "en": "about which you learn before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.13,
          "end": 314.07,
          "en": "of.(context) as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.07,
          "end": 317.22,
          "en": "And context here is not available at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 317.22,
          "end": 319.41,
          "en": "because we're in a StatelessWidget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 319.41,
          "end": 321.09,
          "en": "which unlike the State class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.09,
          "end": 324.84,
          "en": "does not have a globally available context widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 324.84,
          "end": 329.49,
          "en": "And therefore we could either accept it here as an input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 329.49,
          "end": 332.19,
          "en": "and then of course make sure that addItem gets called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 332.19,
          "end": 334.71,
          "en": "to such that the context is passed along.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 334.71,
          "end": 338.573,
          "en": "For example, by wrapping it here into an anonymous function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 338.573,
          "end": 342.36,
          "en": "so that we have full control over how it will be called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 342.36,
          "end": 344.793,
          "en": "And then we could forward context like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 345.96,
          "end": 348.65999999999997,
          "en": "We could do all of that, but since I'm saying could,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.65999999999997,
          "end": 351.12,
          "en": "this is probably not what I'm going to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 351.12,
          "end": 353.46,
          "en": "Instead, I'll go back to this version here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 353.46,
          "end": 356.85,
          "en": "and not accept build context as a parameter here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 356.85,
          "end": 359.19,
          "en": "And instead, I'll convert StatelessWidget here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 359.19,
          "end": 360.66,
          "en": "to a StatefulWidget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 360.66,
          "end": 363.72,
          "en": "because we will later need to manage a list of items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 363.72,
          "end": 366.21,
          "en": "in this widget here anyways, and therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 366.21,
          "end": 369.27,
          "en": "this will have to become a StatefulWidget later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 369.27,
          "end": 371.4,
          "en": "Hence, we can already make this conversion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 371.4,
          "end": 372.93,
          "en": "right-click on StatelessWidget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 372.93,
          "end": 376.92,
          "en": "and refactor and convert it to a StatefulWidget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 376.92,
          "end": 381.45,
          "en": "And with that conversion done, we can now use context here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 381.45,
          "end": 383.61,
          "en": "So with that back here in addItem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 383.61,
          "end": 385.407,
          "en": "I can use Navigator.of(context).",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
